<div class="-mx-4 -mt-6 min-h-screen bg-stone-100 pb-24">
  <header class="relative flex h-16 items-center justify-center bg-white px-4">
    <%= link_to settings_path,
          class: "absolute left-4 flex items-center gap-1 text-stone-900" do %>
      <%= heroicon "chevron-left", type: :outline, class: "h-7 w-7" %>
      <span class="text-sm">設定</span>
    <% end %>

    <h1 class="text-xl font-bold text-stone-900">
      お問い合わせ
    </h1>
  </header>

  <div class="px-4 pt-16">
    <div class="rounded-xl bg-white px-7 py-7">
      <div class="flex justify-center">
        <div class="flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-[3px] border-green-500">
          <%= heroicon "check",
                type: :outline,
                class: "h-9 w-9 stroke-[2.5] text-green-500" %>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-5 text-center text-xl font-medium text-stone-900">
        送信が完了いたしました
      </p>

      <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-sm leading-7 text-center text-stone-900">
        <p>
          内容を確認し、必要に応じてご連絡いたします。
        </p>

        <p>
          返信まで少しお時間をいただく場合があります。
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>